 "notes": "Organised set → card → parallel → grade. Old 'Insert or autograph card' split: autograph items to Autograph card, Gold Logoman Relics to Relic card, Topps Chrome insert names cut from 26 to 8 representative inserts (Big Ticket Players, Chrome Radiating Rookies, Chrome Rivals, Class of 2026 Cooperstown Calls, Fanatical, Numbers Live Forever, Past to Present, Perspectives, Static Noise, Wild Style, World Series at Night, Wrecking Crew dropped as SKU-level). 1986 Fleer Jordan card number #57 and the '1st Bowman' label not stated on any retrieved page, so not recorded. Box card and sealed product have types only; no vintage wax archetype sourced."
